      "text": "……哼～？\\n哦～？[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc01_0110_brother_10",
      "hash64": "EDA34903CD2162F6",
      "text": "不關姐妳的事唄！\\n倒是妳有什……？[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc01_0110_sister_04",
      "hash64": "0F0880773724E9F9",
      "text": "對了，奶奶，\\n我找不到面具。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc01_0110_gmother_11",
      "hash64": "24BE989E930703D5",
      "text": "面具啊，應該是去年\\n收到旁邊的倉庫去了。[VAR 0x0114(0037)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0037"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc01_0110_gfather_06",
      "hash64": "A482EAB30424FD42",
      "text": "那裡的鎖已經打開了，\\n你們一起去拿吧。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc01_0110_sister_05",
      "hash64": "0F087F773724E846",
      "text": "好！旁邊的倉庫是吧！\\n先到先贏～！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "sdc01_0110_brother_11",
      "hash64": "EDA34A03CD2164A9",
      "text": "姐～！妳耍賴！[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "sdc01_0110_gfather_07",
      "hash64": "A482EBB30424FEF5",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]……\\n他們吵吵鬧鬧的，讓[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳見笑了。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
